		IMPL "testing/testIsolation.ts::enforceTestIsolation"
	REJECTED "Making the resolution of bunfig.toml walk upward: the project does not decide it"
	UNTIL "Bun resolves bunfig.toml upward from the working directory"
	RATIONALE "Bun resolves bunfig.toml from the working directory only, without walking upward."
		+ "Without the preload, enforceTestIsolation is not applied and mocks are not restored"
		+ "between tests, without any signal. It is the case of IntelliJ, whose generated Bun"
		+ "configuration takes the folder of the spec as working directory"
	SOURCE "Private context file known-issues/preload-des-tests-ignore-hors-racine-de-package.md,"
		+ "at tag pcst/before-awawa"
		REF @PROJECT.DNC
	SOURCE "Decision of 2026-09-05, task review"
		REF @PULL_REQUEST.PCST61

